==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Znache|Those Guys|Zigge|Hyppoh|Zoge|Cadaver Bear}}
*1 [[Znache]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zigge]] spawns.
